'''Wakamiko Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the Event Capsule during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 475
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Wakamiko Cat
|name2 = Warrior King Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Warrior King Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This is one of the few useful cats in this collab that aren't ubers, as it can be used as a [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] replacement in {{4c}} [[Legend Stages]] with [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies. However, be wary of its high price if you are using it on non-Dark enemy stages. Furthermore, it is not recommended you use this Cat as a generalist, as its stats are lacking against non-Dark enemies.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

